---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { yearsExperience } from '../data/career';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="CV — James Sparkes, Senior Product Designer, London"
  description={`CV for James Sparkes, a senior product designer in London with ${yearsExperience} years of experience across healthtech, ticketing, education and hospitality.`}
  path="/cv"
>
  <div class="cv-view">
    <div class="cv-header">
      <div class="cv-name-block">
        <h1 class="cv-name">James Sparkes</h1>
        <div class="cv-role">Senior Product Designer</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="cv-summary">
      Senior product designer who turns complex, regulated processes into software people can get
      through quickly. {yearsExperience} years designing digital products, including B2B2C platforms in healthtech, ticketing, education and hospitality. I run research, design the workflows and systems, then ship them as
      real frontend code, cutting clicks, duplicate data entry and admin time.
    </p>

    <div class="cv-columns">
      <div class="cv-main">
        <div class="cv-block">
          <div class="cv-sec-head">Experience</div>

          <div class="cv-job">
            <div class="cv-job-top">
              <span class="cv-job-title">Senior Product Designer</span>
              <span class="cv-job-dates">Aug 2025 &ndash; Aug 2026</span>
            </div>
            <div class="cv-job-meta">wawa fertility <span class="cv-loc">&middot; London / Hybrid</span></div>
            <ul class="cv-points">
              <li><strong>Cut referral handling from 20&ndash;40 minutes per patient to a few minutes</strong>, saving hours of admin a day and letting clinics shrink referral teams (one went from four staff to one), via a referral system with AI-assisted auto-ingestion.</li>
              <li><strong>Removed manual checking and data re-entry from regulatory reporting</strong> across four regulators (PRISM, BORN, SART, ANZARD) with one model that adapts to any country and validates data upfront.</li>
              <li><strong>Greatly reduced admin and repeated data entry for every clinic</strong> with one questionnaire builder whose answers feed straight into the clinical system, rolled out to all clinics seamlessly.</li>
              <li><strong>Helped sign three large clinics that were waiting on it</strong> by designing wawa&rsquo;s first treatment planning system, which also simplified billing and stim sheets: standard templates cover 99% of cases and adapt easily for the tricky 1%.</li>
              <li><strong>Moved clinic setup from multi-day, in-person training towards self-serve</strong> with a guided setup flow, chosen at the company all-hands as the template for all future implementations.</li>
              <li><strong>Cut extending a medication from 7+ clicks to one</strong>, saving doctors&rsquo; costliest time; one of many fixes cutting time for doctors, nurses and admin across workflows.</li>
              <li><strong>Cut developer time on smaller features from 1&ndash;2 days to around an hour</strong> by moving design from Figma into the production codebase, so engineers just review a pull request.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="cv-job">
            <div class="cv-job-top">
              <span class="cv-job-title">Senior UX/UI Designer</span>
              <span class="cv-job-dates">Feb 2022 &ndash; Aug 2025</span>
            </div>
            <div class="cv-job-meta">FIXR <span class="cv-loc">&middot; London / Hybrid &middot; incl. freelance 2025</span></div>
            <ul class="cv-points">
              <li><strong>Cited by 30% of high-revenue prospects as a deciding factor in switching to FIXR</strong>: led end-to-end UX for Timed Entry, which became a major sales driver.</li>
              <li>Designed solutions tailored to each prospect&rsquo;s needs that <strong>helped win enterprise organisers worth &pound;100k+ a year on average</strong> away from providers like Ticketmaster, opening up new verticals (museums, exhibitions, visitor attractions).</li>
              <li><strong>Made onboarding self-serve for all small and medium organisers</strong>, freeing the sales team to focus on large accounts.</li>
              <li><strong>Helped FIXR land larger clients and grow revenue</strong> by designing across the full product (event creation, checkout, scanning app, dashboards) and its design system.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <details class="about-more cv-more">
            <summary><span class="about-more-open">Earlier experience</span><span class="about-more-close">Show less</span></summary>
            <div class="cv-more-jobs">
            <div class="cv-job">
              <div class="cv-job-top">
                <span class="cv-job-title">Product Designer</span>
                <span class="cv-job-dates">Jan 2025 &ndash; Apr 2025</span>
              </div>
              <div class="cv-job-meta">H4 Technologies <span class="cv-loc">&middot; Saudi Arabia / Remote &middot; Freelance</span></div>
              <ul class="cv-points">
                <li>Redesigned the core dashboard for an AI-powered ad platform that uses computer vision to track real-world campaign performance.</li>
                <li>Ran UX audits and stakeholder interviews to find the key friction points, then reworked the dashboard&rsquo;s task structure and visual hierarchy.</li>
                <li>Researched user behaviour in the local market and outdoor advertising space to shape a regionally targeted platform.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="cv-job">
              <div class="cv-job-top">
                <span class="cv-job-title">Product Designer</span>
                <span class="cv-job-dates">Jul 2021 &ndash; Feb 2022</span>
              </div>
              <div class="cv-job-meta">AMBIO-N (CircularSource) <span class="cv-loc">&middot; London &middot; Contract</span></div>
              <ul class="cv-points">
                <li>Overhauled the UX of a B2B materials marketplace, improving usability and consistency while communicating each product&rsquo;s environmental impact.</li>
                <li>Designed procurement flows, advanced search and filtering, wishlists, and a sustainability dashboard (carbon footprint, origin, circularity).</li>
                <li>Redesigned the marketing website and built a modular pitch deck for client presentations.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="cv-job">
              <div class="cv-job-top">
                <span class="cv-job-title">Product Designer</span>
                <span class="cv-job-dates">Jan 2021 &ndash; Jul 2021</span>
              </div>
              <div class="cv-job-meta">Kuula TV <span class="cv-loc">&middot; London &middot; Contract</span></div>
              <ul class="cv-points">
                <li>Defined the visual identity and design system for an online yoga teaching platform and its sub-brands.</li>
                <li>Redesigned media management: mobile-first upload flows, sorting and filtering for large libraries, and basic post-upload video editing.</li>
                <li>Designed the marketing website and partner microsites.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="cv-job">
              <div class="cv-job-top">
                <span class="cv-job-title">Product Designer</span>
                <span class="cv-job-dates">Jul 2017 &ndash; Jun 2020</span>
              </div>
              <div class="cv-job-meta">The Collective <span class="cv-loc">&middot; London &middot; Full-time</span></div>
              <ul class="cv-points">
                <li>Lead product designer during rapid growth, digitising staff workflows across the business.</li>
                <li>Designed back-end data management platforms, a members&rsquo; co-living companion app, web apps and the marketing website.</li>
                <li>Designed Acquire, a data-driven land acquisition platform with automated workflows, and improved Colab, a co-living property and finance system.</li>
                <li>Built a shared design system and contributed to the innovation lab&rsquo;s smart home and machine learning work.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="cv-job">
              <div class="cv-job-top">
                <span class="cv-job-title">Product Designer</span>
                <span class="cv-job-dates">May 2016 &ndash; Jun 2016</span>
              </div>
              <div class="cv-job-meta">Maxus <span class="cv-loc">&middot; London &middot; Contract</span></div>
              <ul class="cv-points">
                <li>UX/UI design and QA of data analytics platforms for L&rsquo;Or&eacute;al brands and BT.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="cv-job">
              <div class="cv-job-top">
                <span class="cv-job-title">Graphic Designer</span>
                <span class="cv-job-dates">Feb 2016 &ndash; May 2016</span>
              </div>
              <div class="cv-job-meta">TMW Unlimited <span class="cv-loc">&middot; London &middot; Contract</span></div>
              <ul class="cv-points">
                <li>UX/UI website design and artworking for Sony Mobile, plus print and campaign work for Canon, HSBC and Infinit.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="cv-job">
              <div class="cv-job-top">
                <span class="cv-job-title">Product Designer</span>
                <span class="cv-job-dates">Mar 2015 &ndash; Feb 2016</span>
              </div>
              <div class="cv-job-meta">Breezie <span class="cv-loc">&middot; London &middot; Full-time</span></div>
              <ul class="cv-points">
                <li>UX/UI design for an Android-based operating system for elderly and disabled users, backed by design research and user testing.</li>
                <li>Designed a Samsung SmartThings dashboard.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="cv-job">
              <div class="cv-job-top">
                <span class="cv-job-title">UI Designer</span>
                <span class="cv-job-dates">Mar 2014 &ndash; Mar 2015</span>
              </div>
              <div class="cv-job-meta">Fabric Worldwide <span class="cv-loc">&middot; London &middot; Full-time</span></div>
              <ul class="cv-points">
                <li>UX/UI design for a marketing data analytics platform, and client websites and artwork for Heineken and KFC.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="cv-job">
              <div class="cv-job-top">
                <span class="cv-job-title">Product &amp; Visual Designer</span>
                <span class="cv-job-dates">Mar 2009 &ndash; Feb 2014</span>
              </div>
              <div class="cv-job-meta">QD Design <span class="cv-loc">&middot; Maidstone &middot; Full-time</span></div>
              <ul class="cv-points">
                <li>Designed and built an ecommerce platform, database and warehouse management software.</li>
                <li>Led the rebrand across digital and print, plus advertising, product photography and 3D CAD product design.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cv-side">
        <div class="cv-side-block">
          <div class="cv-sec-head">Skills</div>
          <div class="cv-skill-group">
            <div class="cv-skill-label">Design</div>
            <div class="cv-skill-items">Product &amp; UX/UI design, design systems, prototyping, user research &amp; discovery, interaction design, workflow design, AI-assisted features</div>
          </div>
          <div class="cv-skill-group">
            <div class="cv-skill-label">Engineering</div>
            <div class="cv-skill-items">React, Next.js, TypeScript, HTML/CSS, Tailwind, Ruby on Rails (Phlex), WordPress, InstantDB</div>
          </div>
          <div class="cv-skill-group">
            <div class="cv-skill-label">Data</div>
            <div class="cv-skill-items">Data cleaning &amp; wrangling, regex, spreadsheet modelling, analysis &amp; charting</div>
          </div>
          <div class="cv-skill-group">
            <div class="cv-skill-label">Tools</div>
            <div class="cv-skill-items">Figma, Linear, GitHub, Git, Claude Code</div>
          </div>
          <div class="cv-skill-group">
            <div class="cv-skill-label">Domains</div>
            <div class="cv-skill-items">B2B &amp; B2B2C SaaS, healthtech, regulated &amp; clinical software, multi-jurisdiction compliance, ticketing</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cv-side-block">
          <div class="cv-sec-head">Education</div>
          <div class="cv-edu-item">
            <div class="cv-edu-deg">BA (Hons) Graphic Design &mdash; First Class</div>
            <div class="cv-edu-inst">Canterbury Christ Church University</div>
            <div class="cv-edu-yr">2010&ndash;2013</div>
            <a class="cv-edu-link" href="/blog/">My uni blog &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
